
@SafeVaultMicrosoftCourse_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294

### Register a new user
POST {{SafeVaultMicrosoftCourse_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "leo_dev",
  "email": "leo@example.com",
  "password": "MyStrongPass123!"
}

###

### Login as a registered user
POST {{SafeVaultMicrosoftCourse_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "leo_dev",
  "password": "MyStrongPass123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

###

### Access the authenticated user's profile
GET {{SafeVaultMicrosoftCourse_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Access the admin dashboard
GET {{SafeVaultMicrosoftCourse_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
